sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State:
    CSMS->>CS: GetChargingProfilesRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetChargingProfilesResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: ReportChargingProfilesRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: ReportChargingProfilesResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Test Scenario
    CSMS->>CS: ClearChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfileId = <Generated chargingProfileId>, chargingProfileCriteria omitted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message ClearChargingProfileRequest<br>- chargingProfileId <Generated chargingProfileId> AND<br>- chargingProfileCriteria omit
    CS-->>CSMS: ClearChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
